sequenceDiagram
  title: Login flow
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as Server
  U->>B: Open page
  B->>+S: GET /login
  S-->>-B: 200 OK
  Note right of S: cached
  loop every 5 min
    B-)S: heartbeat
  end
  alt valid password
    S->>B: token
  else invalid
    S-xB: reject
  end
  Note over B,S: TLS everywhere
  B->>B: render
